NOTICE OF MODIFICATIONS
================================================================================
In accordance with Section 3 of the Gemma Terms of Use, notice is hereby given
that this model has been modified from the original Gemma 2 2B base model:

1. Parameter-Efficient Fine-Tuning (PEFT) using LoRA (Low-Rank Adaptation):
   - Base Model: google/gemma-2-2b-it (Google LLC)
   - Target Modules: q_proj, k_proj, v_proj, o_proj, gate_proj, up_proj, down_proj
   - Rank (r): 16, Alpha: 32, Dropout: 0.05
   - Context Window: 512 tokens with dynamic turn sequence collation
   - Training Datasets:
     * Yahir/alpaca-logica-programacion (Lógica y programación)
     * sahil2801/CodeAlpaca-20k (Algoritmos C++, Java, Web)
     * plncmm/spanish-alpaca (Razonamiento, ciencias, valores en español)
     * murdok1982/gemma4-programacion-seguridad (Ciberseguridad defensiva)
2. Weight merging into full-precision SafeTensors format.
3. Quantization to GGUF format (Q4_K_M) optimized for zero-copy memory mapping
   (mmap) execution on edge and mobile ARM64 hardware (Kofu Mobile Android runtime).

